---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Kreativ Sound Companion | BPM Delay Calculator & Creative Prompts" description="A local-first browser extension for tempo-synced delay times, sound-design prompts, and quick access to Kreativ Sound tools." canonical="https://kreativsound.com/tools/kreativ-sound-companion/" activeNav="tools">
  <article class="card page-main companion-page">
    <header class="companion-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Kreativ Sound · Browser extension</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Keep the ideas moving.</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">Delay times, creative prompts, and your favorite Kreativ Sound tools—ready when inspiration strikes.</p>
        <p class="companion-status">Chrome Web Store release in preparation</p>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/tools/">Explore the browser tools</a>
      </div>
      <div class="companion-demo" aria-label="Example delay times at 120 BPM">
        <div class="demo-head"><img src="/kreativ-sound-logo-128.svg" alt="" width="44" height="44" /><span>KREATIV SOUND<small>COMPANION</small></span></div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Delay calculator</p><h2>120 <small>BPM</small></h2>
        <div class="demo-grid"><span>NOTE</span><span>STRAIGHT</span><span>DOTTED</span><span>TRIPLET</span><strong>1/4</strong><span>500 ms</span><span>750 ms</span><span>333.3 ms</span><strong>1/8</strong><span>250 ms</span><span>375 ms</span><span>166.7 ms</span><strong>1/16</strong><span>125 ms</span><span>187.5 ms</span><span>83.3 ms</span></div>
        <p class="demo-note">Illustrative values · calculated locally</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section class="companion-section"><p class="eyebrow">Made for the moments between ideas</p><h2>Less searching. More making.</h2><div class="companion-features">
      <div><h3>Find your delay time</h3><p>Enter your tempo and get straight, dotted, and triplet timings in milliseconds. Copy a value into your favorite effect.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Try a new direction</h3><p>Draw a random sound-design or songwriting prompt when you want a fresh starting point.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Get back to your tools</h3><p>Open Preset Mutator, Wave Mutator, or Pattern Mutator, and explore Kreativ Sound’s sounds and plugins.</p></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="companion-section companion-privacy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Local by design</p><h2>For your creative space.</h2><p>The calculator and prompts work offline. Your last valid tempo is saved in the extension’s local browser storage. The extension sends no data to Kreativ Sound; website links open separately and follow the website’s own privacy settings.</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/tools/kreativ-sound-companion/privacy/">Read extension privacy details</a></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.companion-page{padding:clamp(1.25rem,4vw,2.75rem)}.companion-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:2.5rem;padding:1rem 0 2.5rem}.companion-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:1;max-width:11ch}.companion-hero .page-lead{max-width:32rem;margin:1rem 0;color:var(--muted)}.companion-status{color:var(--accent-strong);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;margin:1.3rem 0}.companion-demo{border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:22px;padding:1.4rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at top right,#99000044,transparent 50%),var(--bg-alt);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)}.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:1.6rem}.demo-head small{display:block;color:var(--accent-bright);letter-spacing:.2em}.companion-demo .eyebrow{margin:0;font-size:.7rem}.companion-demo h2{font-size:2.5rem;margin:.1rem 0 1rem}.companion-demo h2 small{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}.demo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;text-align:right;font-size:.8rem}.demo-grid>*{border-bottom:1px solid var(--card-border);padding:.7rem .1rem}.demo-grid>*:nth-child(4n+1){text-align:left}.demo-grid span:nth-child(-n+4){color:var(--accent-strong);font-size:.65rem}.demo-note{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1rem}.companion-section{border-top:1px solid var(--card-border);padding:2rem 0}.companion-section h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.4rem);line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:1.2rem}.companion-features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}.companion-features>div{border:1px solid var(--card-border);background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:16px;padding:1.2rem}.companion-features h3{margin-bottom:.5rem}.companion-features p,.companion-privacy p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--muted)}.companion-privacy{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem}.companion-privacy div{max-width:42rem}.companion-privacy .button{flex-shrink:0}@media(max-width:700px){.companion-hero,.companion-features{grid-template-columns:1fr}.companion-privacy{display:block}.companion-privacy .button{margin-top:1.2rem}.companion-hero{gap:1.5rem}}
</style>
